# Sign in with Google (docs/google-sign-in.md). These are OAuth client IDs, not secrets: they are inside every copy of the
# app. Every EXPO_PUBLIC_ value is written into the app when it is built or bundled, so changing one needs the dev server
# restarted with `npx expo start --clear`, and the iOS one a new build.
